@startuml pipeline_sequence
title Diagramme de séquence - Exécution d'une analyse (job)

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "Helvetica"
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

skinparam participant {
  BackgroundColor #F4F8FB
  BorderColor #2C3E50
  FontColor #2C3E50
}
skinparam actor {
  BackgroundColor #EAF2F8
  BorderColor #2C3E50
}
skinparam database {
  BackgroundColor #FDF2E9
  BorderColor #B9770E
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FEF9E7
  BorderColor #B7950B
}
skinparam ArrowColor #2C3E50
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #95A5A6

actor "Chercheur" as Chercheur
participant "Frontend" as Frontend
participant "Gateway" as Gateway
participant "GenomicsValidation" as GEN
participant "ProteinAnalysis" as PROT
participant "DrugDiscovery" as DRUG
participant "Histopathology" as HIST
database "DB" as DB

Chercheur -> Frontend : Lancer une analyse
Frontend -> Gateway : POST /api/v1/jobs
Gateway -> DB : créer Job (status=pending)
Gateway --> Frontend : 201 (id)
Frontend --> Chercheur : Job créé

note over Gateway, HIST : Tâche d'arrière-plan (asynchrone)\nChaque étape encapsulée dans try/except\n(tolérante aux pannes)

Gateway -> GEN : /validate
GEN --> Gateway : validation_result

Gateway -> PROT : /analyze (meilleur ORF)
PROT --> Gateway : analysis_result

Gateway -> DRUG : /predict
DRUG --> Gateway : drug_result

Gateway -> HIST : /predict-mutation
HIST --> Gateway : histopathology_result

Gateway -> Gateway : fusion croisée
Gateway -> DB : status=completed

par Suivi en parallèle
  loop polling toutes les 3 s
    Frontend -> Gateway : GET /jobs/{id}
    Gateway -> DB : lire l'état
    DB --> Gateway : avancement
    Gateway --> Frontend : retourne l'avancement
  end
end

@enduml
